OpenCoarrays
------------------------------------------
OpenCoarrays supports Fortran 2018 compilers by providing a parallel
application binary interface (ABI) that abstracts away the underlying parallel
programming model, which can be the Message Passing Interface (MPI) or
OpenSHMEM. Parallel Fortran 2018 programs may be written and compiled into
object files once and then linked or re-linked to either MPI or OpenSHMEM
without modifying or recompiling the Fortran source. Not a single line of
source code need change to switch parallel programming models. The default
programming model is MPI because it provides the broadest capability for
supporting Fortran 2018 features. However, having the option to change parallel
programming models at link-time may enhance portability and performance (see
Rouson et al. (2017)).

Runtime requirements:
  bash-5.2.21-1
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcaf_mpi3-2.10.3-1bl1
  libgfortran5-14.4.0-1
  libopencoarrays_mod2-2.10.3-1bl1
  libopenmpi40-4.1.6-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-fortran-14.4.0-1
  libevent-devel-2.1.13-1
  libhwloc-devel-2.13.0-1
  libopenmpi-devel-4.1.6-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/sourceryinstitute/OpenCoarrays

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/sourceryinstitute/OpenCoarrays/archive/refs/tags/2.10.3.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack OpenCoarrays-2.10.3-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./OpenCoarrays-2.10.3-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/OpenCoarrays-2.10.3-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/OpenCoarrays-2.10.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcaf_mpi3-2.10.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcaf_mpi-devel-2.10.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libopencoarrays_mod2-2.10.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libopencoarrays_mod-devel-2.10.3-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

